	(text "NFC ANTENNA PARAMETERS\n\nType:                 PCB Spiral Coil (Double Layer)\nFrequency:            13.56 MHz\nSize:                 12 mm x 12 mm\nLayers:               TOP + BOTTOM copper\nTurns:                6 total (3 TOP + 3 BOTTOM)\nConnection:           Series through vias\n\nPCB:\nSubstrate:            FR-4\nThickness:            1.6 mm\nRelative Er:          4.4\nCopper thickness:     35 um\n\nGeometry:\nTrack width:          0.5 mm\nTrack spacing:        0.5 mm\nOuter diameter:       12 mm\nInner diameter:       6 mm\nAverage diameter:     9 mm\n\nElectrical:\nInductance:           460 nH\nDC resistance:        220 mOhm\nParallel resistance:  3500 Ohm\nSelf resonance:       200 MHz\nQ factor @13.56 MHz:  ~117\n\nMatching target:\nIC:                   ST25R100\nOperating frequency:  13.56 MHz\n\nNotes:\nThe antenna consists of two coupled spiral coils:\n- 3 turns on TOP copper\n- 3 turns on BOTTOM copper\n- connected in series using vias\n\nThe antenna is modeled as a single 6-turn equivalent coil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 472.948 227.076 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e1c54098-3b39-45ad-a7a5-9cbd6fe14f9e")
	)
